                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]\r\nControl your dude and shoot enemies. You can store up 3 bullets at once then you need to find new weapon. Plenty of modes like survival, deathmatch, tag, dodge and one more. Visual style is unique and somewhat unusual. Sounds are good and rather subtle especially on headphones. I don't find this game fun for single player although it might be fun when playing with friend. Overall it's not a bad game but rather shallow.\r\n[/h1]",
